    "english":  "The cool mountain stream rushes over glistening pebbles,\ncarrying fragrant petals from the high cliffs of Kurinji.\nThe peacock spreads its iridescent tail upon the rocky ridge,\nmistaking the dark gathering clouds for evening shadows.\nO guardian of my heart, you who come through the misty woods at night,\nbeware the mountain spirits and the fierce tusked boars!\nOur love cannot remain concealed forever beneath mother\u0027s watchful gaze;\ncome openly with your elders to our mountain hamlet,\nand claim me with ancient rites before the sacred fire!",
